    <statement><p>Determine whether the following planes below are <em> parallel</em>, <em> perpendicular</em>, or <em> neither</em>.</p>
<p><ul form="popup" name="AnSwEr0001"><li>
<p>choose one</p>
</li><li>
<p>Parallel</p>
</li><li>
<p>Perpendicular</p>
</li><li>
<p>Neither</p>
</li></ul> <alert> 1. </alert>  <m>x+2y-6z=0</m> and <m>-3 x-6 y +18 z = -3</m>.</p>
<p><ul form="popup" name="AnSwEr0002"><li>
<p>choose one</p>
</li><li>
<p>Parallel</p>
</li><li>
<p>Perpendicular</p>
</li><li>
<p>Neither</p>
</li></ul> <alert> 2. </alert>  <m>x-3y+z=0</m> and <m>-x-4 y +z = 5</m>.</p>
<p><ul form="popup" name="AnSwEr0003"><li>
<p>choose one</p>
</li><li>
<p>Parallel</p>
</li><li>
<p>Perpendicular</p>
</li><li>
<p>Neither</p>
</li></ul> <alert> 3. </alert>  <m>x+7 z=0</m> and <m>7 x- z = 3</m>.</p>
<p><alert> Note:</alert>  <em> You only have two attempts at this problem.</em></p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>\text{Parallel}</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>\text{Neither}</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>\text{Perpendicular}</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
